Generates a list of all existing, new and defunct drugs.

1) Download allfiles*.zip from the Health Canada Drug Product Database (DPD):
http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/prodpharma/databasdon/dpd_bdpp_data_extract-eng.php

2) Unzip all files then run ./convert.sh to remove windows-style endlines.
3) Run the load_data.sql in the patrick_sandbox database
4) Run ./generate_lookup_data.sh to generate existing.csv and new.csv files
